    "sections": {
        "description": "Ignite Grocery is a clean and functional theme designed for online grocery stores and food-related websites. It offers a structured layout that helps display products such as fresh produce, packaged goods, and daily essentials in an organized way. The theme includes responsive design, customizable sections, product grids, and easy navigation, making it suitable for both small and large inventories. It also supports basic SEO optimization, fast loading speed, and mobile-friendly performance, which are important for improving visibility and user experience. Ignite Grocery can be used by grocery shop owners, local food sellers, supermarkets, organic stores, and delivery-based businesses looking to create an efficient online presence. It works well for users who want a simple setup without complex configurations. With support for eCommerce features, secure checkout integration, and category management, Ignite Grocery provides a practical solution for managing and showcasing grocery products online."
    },
